{"duration_api_ms":156738,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1f0667a5-4391-4e7c-be07-38918e4852f3","total_cost_usd":0.216076,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15863,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15262,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":10670},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15863,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15262,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15863,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15863},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15262,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15863,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.216076,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":10670,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The front is a one-parameter family at D=3.385, bluntness 1.2, cone 70, swept in flight path angle. It runs from gamma -1.5 (flux 227k W/m2, bondline 417.9 K) to the g limit at gamma about -3.57 (flux 274.6k, 391.1 K). D is capped by the mass-fraction limit at about 3.3852. Bluntness and cone are at the edge of the region where the cd_fore surrogate can be evaluated. Hypervolume has barely moved over the last three rounds (0.3545, 0.3554, 0.3555), so only small gains remain. I use this round to fill gaps along the family and to test tiny D and gamma refinements at the g and mass limits.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-81e40e27ff03 (gamma -3.57) has g margin 4.7e-5 and mass margin 1.4e-4. C-96e48a93fd32 (D 3.3852, gamma -3.5695) has mass margin 2.7e-5 and g margin 1.2e-4. Together they put the D ceiling near 3.38524 and the gamma cap near -3.570.\",\"C-2a109f1c4205 (D 3.36, gamma -3.58) and C-363a563b3536 (D 3.3, gamma -3.58) are dominated by the D=3.385 family. Flux rises by about 10k for a 0.085 m drop in D, roughly a D^-1.5 dependence, while the g limit allows only a very small gamma gain.\",\"C-7112b6b29bcf, C-14444dd6b10a, C-9961e7e6987c and C-67c6047be079 show that lowering bluntness or cone both raises flux and breaks the mass-fraction limit.\",\"C-ea0e387c4c00, C-ae614eb129f2, C-3d41ce848a30 and C-98457c6f78bd fail on cd_fore extrapolation for bluntness above 1.2 or cone below 70 at bluntness 1.2, so (1.2, 70) is the corner of the valid region.\",\"Rows from C-948029610632 (gamma -1.5) to C-81e40e27ff03 (gamma -3.57) form a smooth, convex flux-vs-bondline curve. About 0.001 deg of gamma near the cap trades about 10 mK for about 22 W/m2.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak flux falls with nose radius (bluntness x D) and with ballistic coefficient (larger D), so D, bluntness and cone are pushed to their limits. Peak g depends mainly on gamma, with a weak positive dependence on D of about 0.4 g/m. Bondline temperature falls as entry gets steeper because the soak time is shorter. The trade-off is therefore set by gamma alone, from shallow (low flux, hot bondline) to the g cap (higher flux, cooler bondline). Physics here is from the data plus prior knowledge: in Allen-Eggers theory peak g is independent of ballistic coefficient. I expect more gamma points to add only a small hypervolume gain, and the D and gamma micro-tweaks to add almost none.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Some proposed gamma values may already have been evaluated in the truncated rows I cannot see. The micro-tweaks near the mass and g limits could fall just over either limit, since I am extrapolating locally linear slopes to about 1e-5 relative margin. The interpolated flux and temperature values are linear estimates. The true curve is convex, so actual values should sit slightly below them. I have no data on any geometry outside this family that could beat it.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the shallow end of the front between gamma -1.5 and -1.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds coverage near the shallow extreme of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.7 on the family.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.62},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front near the shallow end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.8 and -1.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.85},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.9 and -2.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":236500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.9 and -2.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.1 and -2.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.2 and -2.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.33},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":245000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front in the mid range.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.2 and -2.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.38},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.45 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":250600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.7 and -2.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.82},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.0 and -3.18.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.09},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.0 and -3.18.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.13},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":264000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.18 and -3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.24},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.3 and -3.38.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.45 and -3.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.47},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.5 and -3.562.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.53},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.48,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.5 and -3.562.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.29,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.562 and -3.57 near the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.566},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.13,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front at the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Push D to the mass-fraction ceiling (about 3.38524) with gamma just steeper than -3.57. My estimate is that g stays just under 12.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38522,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5701},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274530,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.09,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"This is the last micro-gain at the g and mass corner. It would slightly dominate C-81e40e27ff03 if it stays feasible.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Same corner probe with gamma slightly steeper and D a hair smaller, to bracket the limits.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38521,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5702},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274540,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.09,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Brackets the feasibility boundary at the g and mass corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":122649,"type":"result","duration_ms":156784,"uuid":"28ecc98f-c3e3-466d-a4c1-f92d94117fa3","ttft_stream_ms":1073,"time_to_request_ms":44,"first_content_frame_ms":1073,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
